let gloves be ask "how many gloves"
let masks be ask "how many masks"
let bandages be ask "how many bandages"
let gel be ask "how many hand gel"
if gloves is below 20, say 40 minus gloves
if masks is below 15, say 30 minus masks
if bandages is below 30, say 60 minus bandages
if gel is below 10, say 20 minus gel
if nothing, say "Nothing to order this week."
